# Changelog Rules

The agent MUST update `CHANGELOG.md` after ANY change.

This includes:
- Code
- Config
- Assets
- Build system
- Documentation

## Format Rules

- Every entry must start with a date: YYYY-MM-DD
- Entries go under: ## [Unreleased]
- Version headers are NEVER created or modified by the agent

## Structure

## [Unreleased]

### Added
- 2026-03-23: Description

### Changed
- 2026-03-23: Description

### Fixed
- 2026-03-23: Description

### Performance
- 2026-03-23: Description

### Internal
- 2026-03-23: Description

## Behaviour Rules

- Append only, never rewrite existing entries
- Group logically under correct section
- Keep entries concise and technical
- Always reflect the actual change made

## Completion Rule

A task is NOT complete unless:
- CHANGELOG.md has been updated